                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/16986.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Simpich to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nogales</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-12-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 21, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>General Obregon arriving Nogales tonight desires permission pass through United
                    States to El Paso, wishes leave Nogales tonight. Suggest commanding officer
                    Nogales, Arizona, be instructed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Simpich.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
